	(text "There aren't really isolated amplifiers on the\nmarket that let us achieve the desired granularity\nwith a small shunt resistor, and with the single\nended output needed to interface with the PSOM ADC. \nTherefore i chose to use a discrete, isolated ADC. \n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 23.622 0)
